     "<div lang=\"EN-GB\" link=\"blue\" vlink=\"purple\"><div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt;font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;;color:#1f497d\"> </span></p>\n<div style=\"border:none;border-top:solid #b5c4df 1.0pt;padding:3.0pt 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\">From:</span></b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;sans-serif&quot;\"> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a> [mailto:<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a>]\n<b>On Behalf Of </b>Manuel Spínola<br>\n<b>Sent:</b> 19 April 2012 14:41<br>\n<b>To:</b> ggplot2<br>\n<b>Subject:</b> Question on a simple plot</span></p>\n</div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"> </p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\">Dear list members,</p>\n<div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"> </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\">How can I produce this plot in ggplot2 (I am thinking in the &quot;s&quot; argument, how can be done in ggplot2)?</p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"> </p>\n</div>\n<div>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:36.0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;LucidaGrande&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">x <span style=\"color:navy\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:navy\">c(</span><span style=\"color:#004200\">0</span><span style=\"color:navy\">,</span><span style=\"color:#004200\">235</span><span style=\"color:navy\">,</span><span style=\"color:#004200\">280</span><span style=\"color:navy\">,</span><span style=\"color:#004200\">365</span><span style=\"color:navy\">)</span></span> <br>\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;LucidaGrande&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">y <span style=\"color:navy\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:navy\">c(</span><span style=\"color:#004200\">1</span><span style=\"color:navy\">,</span><span style=\"color:#004200\">0.94</span><span style=\"color:navy\">,</span><span style=\"color:#004200\">0.89</span><span style=\"color:navy\">,</span><span style=\"color:#004200\">0.89</span><span style=\"color:navy\">)</span></span> <br>\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;LucidaGrande&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">li <span style=\"color:navy\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:navy\">c(</span><span style=\"color:#004200\">1</span><span style=\"color:navy\">,</span><span style=\"color:#004200\">0.85</span><span style=\"color:navy\">,</span><span style=\"color:#004200\">0.77</span><span style=\"color:navy\">,</span><span style=\"color:#004200\">0.77</span><span style=\"color:navy\">)</span></span> <br>\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;LucidaGrande&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">ls <span style=\"color:navy\">&lt;-</span> <span style=\"color:navy\">c(</span><span style=\"color:#004200\">1</span><span style=\"color:navy\">,</span><span style=\"color:#004200\">1</span><span style=\"color:navy\">,</span><span style=\"color:#004200\">1</span><span style=\"color:navy\">,</span><span style=\"color:#004200\">1</span><span style=\"color:navy\">)</span></span> <br>\n <br>\n<br>\n<span style=\"font-family:&quot;LucidaGrande&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;;color:navy\">plot(</span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;LucidaGrande&quot;,&quot;serif&quot;\">x<span style=\"color:navy\">,</span>y<span style=\"color:navy\">,</span>type<span style=\"color:navy\">=</span><span style=\"color:#a00000\">&quot;s&quot;</span><span style=\"color:navy\">,</span>ylim<span style=\"color:navy\">=c(</span><span style=\"color:#004200\">0</span><span style=\"color:navy\">,</span><span style=\"color:#004200\">1</span><span style=\"color:navy\">))</span></span> <br>\n<span style=\"font-family:&quo