   "subject": "Re: Question on a simple plot",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "with the existing data you could do it like this<div><br></div><div><div>comb &lt;- data.frame(x = x, y=y, li=li, ls=ls)</div><div><br></div><div><div>ggplot(comb)+geom_step(aes(x =x, y=y))+</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>geom_step(aes(x =x, y=li), linetype=2)+</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>geom_step(aes(x =x, y=ls), linetype=2)+</div><div><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>scale_y_continuous(limits=c(0,1))</div></div><div><br></div><div>Sincerely</div><div><br></div><div>Rasmus Engholm</div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
